{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16207583","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16207583","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1620758301:0":{"text":"どう？体はもう大丈夫？恋愛薬の影響がまだ残ってるような感覚はない？","source_cn":"怎么样，你身体还好吗？有感觉到爱情魔药的残留吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC9AB3B7DAE691BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620758302:0":{"text":"い、今飲んだのって、恋愛薬だったの？ウソ……僕、とんでもないことしちゃったんじゃ……","source_cn":"我刚刚喝下的是爱情魔药？糟了……我、我做错事了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x212A77441C5F8F67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620758303:1":{"text":"とんでもないこと？","source_cn":"做错事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4478CA9D215E843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620758304:1":{"text":"実は以前、何度かレナに告白したことがあるんだ。どれも受け入れてもらえなかったけど……","source_cn":"我以前为了制造“惊喜”，曾冒昧地向蕾娜公开表白过好几次...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x091A126ADCD46EAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620758305:1":{"text":"でも、さっき急に気付いたんだ。本当の恋は一本通行じゃなくて、互いの心が響き合うものなんだって。なのに僕は、まだ親しくもないうちから、みんなの前で何度も告白して……ずいぶん困らせちゃっただろうな。","source_cn":"刚才我突然明白过来，真正的爱情不是一厢情愿，而是双方的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1768182ACEC3FAE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":""